## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the
frame loop and the elapsed time it measures, the canvas fit, keyboard, pointer
and touch input, image loading, audio, and the debug overlay. Where this
specification speaks of the runtime it means that layer, and it states only what
Floe needs from it. How the layer is structured is yours to decide.
{{else if (eq engine.slug "simple-2d")}}
