### The build interface

`npm ci` followed by `npm run build` produces the complete static site into
`dist/` at the repository root, with an `index.html` at the root of that
directory as the entry point. That directory runs correctly when served as-is at
any base path of any static file server, so every URL the build requests at
runtime resolves against the page rather than against the origin root. The
scripts that do this are already in `package.json`.

## Goal of this build

Produce a complete, polished, playable game that runs entirely in a browser. Aim
for a game a person would enjoy playing.

The build ships all six of the game's screens: the title screen, the how-to
screen, the live crossing, the pause menu, the victory screen, and the game-over
screen. `specs/ui.md` fixes what each one shows and how the game moves between
them.

